Subject: [PATCH 2/4] test(claude-eval): G256-3 pure alias switch receipt

Experimental receipt binding alias, old/new generation, descriptor and
manifest digests and a switch id; replay, incomplete, unobserved switch and
broken chains are refused. Retirement facts derive only from a chain that
ends on the alias read now. No file, no client, no deletion.

